# --- never commit someone's library or their credentials --------------------
# Source corpora. `raw/` is the default; add your own if you point littax
# elsewhere. These are other people's copyrighted papers - keep them local.
raw/
papers/
library/
*.pdf

.env

# Personal config. config.example.toml is the one that ships.
# (Note: git has no inline comments — a trailing comment becomes part of the
# pattern and silently matches nothing.)
config.toml

